<title>UK: Century says no Whitbread approach.</title>
<headline>Century says no Whitbread approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent pub company Century Inns Plc has received no approach from brewer to leisure group Whitbread Plc, said finance director Barry Whitehead on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It comes as a big surprise. We know of no interest being shown in us by Whitbread,&quot; Whitehead said in an interview.</p>
<p>The Times newspaper reported speculation that Whitbread may have given Century Inns a &quot;close look,&quot; sending its shares 8p higher to 193p in early trade.</p>
